              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UHushayi wasesithi kuAbisalomu: Hatshi! kepha lowo uJehova amkhethayo nalaba bantu nawo wonke amadoda akwa-Israyeli ngiyoba ngowakhe, ngihlale naye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.18",
